REM Golden case: explicit typed declaration forms (#constant unfolding is a
REM pre-parse stage outside this hermetic pipeline, so literals are used).
REM Exercises: global typed declarations and typed variable creation.
global gCounter as integer
global gRatio as float
global gName as string
gCounter = gCounter + 1
gRatio = 0.5
gName$ = "player"
hp = 100
end
